{
  "bookId": "hero-211002",
  "id": "bond-27504",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27504001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "不行。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "抗议。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "抗议无效。\n我问你，现在这个家谁说了算？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27504005",
              "text": "你。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27504006",
              "text": "我。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27504004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "没错，既然被委托管账，我会负起责任。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "从你委托我来管账的那一刻起——\n你就不再是一家之主了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但是我想买很久了！\n错过这次再贩，肯定要等到地老天荒！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "......好吧，可以破例一次，但有条件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "买下以后，由我替你保管。\n如果表现好就送给你，否则——直接转卖给二手商店。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "表现好？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "早睡早起，节俭开销，坚持锻炼，每天打扫卫生。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "把我当成小孩子了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "那就接受挑战，证明自己是成熟的大人。\n如何？成交的话，来拉钩吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "没想到，再次住进「房子」的一天，会以这种方式到来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "病毒爆发以来，「萤火小队」四处奔波解救幸存者，居无定所......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "现在可以安定下来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我忍不住会想......如果再早一些该多好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27504018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "我所挂怀的人们，有些已经永远离开了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
